        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Irakli Nasidze\n- Places: Tbilisi, Georgia, Kura River\n- Topics: Georgian artists, city names, population\n\nFacts:\n- Irakli Nasidze was born in 1973 in Tbilisi.\n- Irakli Nasidze is a Georgian artist.\n- Tbilisi is the capital and largest city of Georgia.\n- Tbilisi lies on the banks of the Kura River.\n- Tbilisi has a population of approximately 1.5 million people.\n- Tbilisi was internationally designated as Tiflis before 1936, and some countries still use that name.",
